WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,190
Can I be deceived? Why?

2
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:27,590
Because I won’t look at the lucky ones who come to me

3
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:36,660
My sister hates people’s hatred the most. Your sister is dead and lost.

4
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:39,980
If she is still alive

5
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:40,980
About the same age as you

6
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:44,350
After mom is gone

7
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:45,550
It was me who pulled her

8
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:47,150
In junior high school, I sent her to the ancestor worship area.
